  "description": "Call Qwen chat endpoints on DashScope, vLLM or Ollama while using the shared Mythosia.AI conversation and tool APIs. QwenService supports provider-specific thinking controls, custom deployment names, streaming usage, immutable request configuration, cancellable local tools, controllable runs and local model-capability inspection. Requires Mythosia.AI 8.1.0. Native steering, hosted search and image generation are outside this adapter.",
